"description":"Are you the imposter - or will you expose them?\n\nImposter is the perfect game for groups that love fun, suspense, and a bit of deception. Playable with 3 or more players - no internet needed.\n\nEach round, every player gets a secret word. Everyone? Not quite! One player receives only \"IMPOSTER\".\nNow it's time to improvise: Each person gives a clue in one sentence. The imposter has to guess the word. The others must figure out who's lying.\n\nNow with a brand new game mode: 'Find the Liar' - everyone is asked the same question, except one player who secretly receives a different one. After all players answer, it's time to debate, discuss, and vote on who they think the liar is!\n\nWhy you'll love it:\n• Offline play - perfect for travel\n• Easy to learn, quick to start\n• Multiple categories and difficulty levels\n• Great for friends, family, school trips & parties\n• Strategy, bluffing & lots of laughs guaranteed!\n\nWill you expose the imposter - or bluff your way to victory?\n\nTerms of Use: \nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula\nPrivacy Policy: \nhttps://imposter-app.com/privacy", "minimumOsVersion":"12.0", "bundleId":"at.vucak.impostor", "trackCensoredName":"Imposter Game - Party Edition", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/imposter-game-party-edition/id6745120053?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.83715000000000028279600883251987397670745849609375, "sellerName":"Sven Vucak", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "userRatingCount":91643}]
